╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [Bug]: LocalWorkspace.list_tools raises AttributeError on current main                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ## Description                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ <img width="1076" height="744" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5ec59df-e713-413e-9d10-a7cf378c71ac" />             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ `LocalWorkspace.list_tools()` raises the following exception on the current `main` branch:                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```text                                                                                                                                         │
│ AttributeError: 'LocalWorkspace' object has no attribute '_glob_helper_path'                                                                    │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This prevents the agent service from constructing the toolkit for a local workspace when a user starts a chat.                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Reproduction                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Environment:                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - AgentScope: editable installation from current `main`                                                                                         │
│ - Python: 3.11.12                                                                                                                               │
│ - Workspace: `LocalWorkspace`                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ import asyncio                                                                                                                                  │
│ import tempfile                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ from agentscope.workspace import LocalWorkspace                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ async def main() -> None:                                                                                                                       │
│     with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as path:                                                                                                 │
│         workspace = LocalWorkspace(workdir=path)                                                                                                │
│         await workspace.initialize()                                                                                                            │
│         try:                                                                                                                                    │
│             await workspace.list_tools()                                                                                                        │
│         finally:                                                                                                                                │
│             await workspace.close()                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ asyncio.run(main())                                                                                                                             │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Root cause                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This appears to be a regression introduced by commit `81538d35`.                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The v2.0.4 release and the parent of that commit both define the following default on `WorkspaceBase`:                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ _glob_helper_path: str | None = None                                                                                                            │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ The commit removed that attribute while retaining the access in `WorkspaceBase.list_tools()`. `SandboxedWorkspaceBase` overrides                │
│ `_glob_helper_path`, but `LocalWorkspace` inherits directly from `WorkspaceBase`, so the attribute is missing.                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ## Suggested fix                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Restore the default `_glob_helper_path: str | None = None` class attribute on `WorkspaceBase` and add a regression test covering                │
│ `LocalWorkspace.list_tools()`.                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ @DavdGao, I would be happy to submit the small fix and regression test if this approach looks good.                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
